  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.mado-hosting.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1001299/description_966fb4de-7ee5-4b7e-8e27-09300d5a2105.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"90\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://scalacube.com/p/_hosting_server_minecraft/4516718\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1001299/description_453d6b5f-f055-4227-9d7f-65d26290bfdd.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://scalacube.com/p/_hosting_server_minecraft/4516718\" rel=\"nofollow\">&nbsp;</a></p><hr><h1 style=\"text-align:center\">敲門者</h1><p style=\"text-align:left\">這個模組由<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-man-from-the-fog\" rel=\"nofollow\">迷霧中的男人</a>的創作者製作，新增了一個單一實體，並伴隨著多種機制和事件。它會根據不同情況跟蹤、驚嚇或攻擊你。由於其增強機制，它甚至知道你的住所！如需支援或回報錯誤，請造訪下方的 Discord 連結。</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/MCso8KuAn0o?si=A5881VE32f_Emslg\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"display:table;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j-To15wmf60?si=fAQcYTC9abfQsWdQ\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><hr><p style=\"text-align:left\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/JgWNMWykdh\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://d12jofbmgge65s.cloudfront.net/wp-content/uploads/2023/01/tech-guide_header-image-discord.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"69\" height=\"69\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>",
